// The window strips a door picture is built from. Each source is one top
// section Clopay rendered (/doors/bands/<file>.webp): `cap` the door's edges
// left and right, `cells` each window (or pair) as [from, to, centre] in source
// pixels, `fill` a run of plain face [x, width] used for the face between windows,
// `wins` each window's own frame [x0, y0, x1, y1] (a Modern Steel door takes the window alone).
// STRIP_SEQ lists, per family and design, the cells laid left to right for a
// given number of long or short panels across (SPAN_LONG); the windows sit on
// as many equal places as the list is long. A count not listed is not drawn.

